    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled just outside Riverstown, this exceptionally spacious four-bedroom bungalow offers a rare opportunity to enjoy peaceful countryside living while remaining within easy reach of nearby towns and amenities.\r\n\r\nOccupying a site of approximately 0.7 acres, the property enjoys beautiful views over Lough Nasool and is located just a few metres from Lough Bo.\r\n\r\nInternally, the home offers bright accommodation throughout, with spacious living areas, making it an ideal choice for families, retirees, or those seeking additional space for remote working. Large windows allow natural light to flood the home while framing the picturesque countryside and lake views.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a generous private garden offering excellent space for children, entertaining, gardening or simply relaxing in the peaceful surroundings.\r\nThere is ample parking to the front, with plenty of space for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nJust 8 minutes from Riverstown, offering shops, cafés, takeaways and local services. Riverstown is also well known as the home of the popular James Morrison Festival.\r\nLough Bo is only a short stroll away, providing excellent fishing opportunities.\r\nNational schools are available in both Riverstown and Boyle, making the property well suited to family living.\r\nConvenient access to the N4, with Boyle and Carrick-on-Shannon both easily reached.\r\nBoyle Train Station provides regular rail services to Dublin, making commuting and travel straightforward.\r\nApproximately 23 minutes to Sligo Town and  Strandhill , offering beautiful beaches, surfing, cafés and restaurants.\r\nIreland West Airport Knock is approximately 45 minutes away, providing excellent national and international connectivity.\r\nExcellent broadband availability makes the property an ideal choice for those working remotely."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "PORCH                                         1.4m x 0.8m\r\n\r\nHALL                                             1.6m x 4.5m, 6.8m x 1m\r\nTiled flooring. \r\n\r\nLIVING AREA                                3.4m x 4.3m\r\nCarpet flooring. Fireplace.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN                                       5.4m x 3.1m\r\nFitted kitchen units. Refrigerator. Oven. \r\nWashing machine. Sky light window. Stove\r\nwith back boiler.\r\n\r\nHALL                                             5.2m x 1.1m,  1.8m x 1m\r\nTiled flooring.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM                                 2.2m x 1.9m\r\nTiled floor. Tiled walls. WC. WHB. Walk-in\r\nshower.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1                                 4.2m x 3.1m\r\nCarpet flooring. Double room. Built-in\r\nwardrobe.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2                                 4.4m x 3.8m\r\nCarpet flooring. Double room.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3                                 2.9m x 2.9m\r\nCarpet Floor. Double room.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4                                 2.9m x 1.8m\r\nCarpet Flooring. Single room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Exceptionally spacious four-bedroom bungalow\r\n- Site extending to approximately 0.7 acres\r\n- Stunning views overlooking Lough Nasool\r\n- Just metres from Lough Bo\r\n- Bright accommodation\r\n- Large private garden\r\n- Ample parking\r\n- Excellent broadband available\r\n- Easy access to the N4, Boyle, Carrick-on- Shannon and Sligo \r\n- Close to schools, shops and everyday amenities"
      },
